'''''Pokémon: Path to the Peak''''' (Japanese: '''{{j|PATH TO THE PEAK 頂へのきずな}}''' ''Path to the Peak: Bonds to the Peak'') is a short {{pkmn|animation|animated}} series and the first to be based on the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. The series takes place in a world where Pokémon as creatures do not exist, but Pokémon as a multimedia franchise does.

It was announced in the [[Pokémon Presents]] released on {{DL|Pokémon Presents|August 8, 2023}}. The first episode premiered on YouTube on August 11, 2023, during the week of the [[2023 Pokémon World Championships|2023]] [[World Championships|Pokémon World Championships]]. A screening of the entire 4-episode series was also held at the Championships itself.<ref>[https://www.dicebreaker.com/games/pokemon-trading-card-game/feature/pokemon-path-to-the-peak-charming-intro-to-card-game Pokémon's new animated series Path to the Peak is a charming introduction to the trading card game - Dicebreaker]</ref>

On January 11, 2024, it was announced that the series has been nominated for an {{wp|Annie Award}} for Best TV/Media – Limited Series.<ref>https://twitter.com/CartoonEmpire_/status/1745485760151626238</ref> On April 10, 2024, ''Pokémon: Path to the Peak'' was nominated for the {{wp|Webby Awards}} in the Video – Animation category.<ref>https://twitter.com/Pokemon/status/1778152525503603179</ref>

